  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samisoni wakunkumukili hakuya kuTimina. MuTimina wamwenumu mumbanda wakudi anyana kawaFwilistinu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafuntilikudi tata yindi namama yindi nakuyileja nindi, Namoni muTimina mumbandawakudi anyana kawaFwilistinu; dichi dinu kansumbwiliyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichitata yindi namama yindi amwilili nawu, Hadi ana kweyi hela hadi akwetutwa semuka nawu, kwosi mumbandaku tahindi, mwaka wuyi wakasumbuli mumbanda wakudi aFwilistinu ayidima? Samisoni hakumwila tata yindinindi, Nsumbwiliyi; namumoni himuwahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa tata yindi namama yindi hiyelukili nawu chinafumi kudi Yehovaku, muloŋa wakeŋa eli hakuvulumwina nsaŋu nawaFwilistinu, muloŋa hamwakawuna aFwilistinu ekala dehi anyanta jawaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samisoni hakukunkumuka nitata yindi nimama yindi, hiyakuya kuTimina, ashika nikumatempa anyivinyu akuTimina. Kutala mutupahakwinza nakubuluma kudi yena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaYehova wenjili hadi yena naŋovu, Samisoni yomutabula nimutupa bwe-chi neyi kwiji hakutabula kanakampembi, kutopa kuchikasa chindi hikwadiŋi chumaku. Halejeli kwindihela tata yindi hela mama yindi mweliliyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakunkumukili nakuyanakuhanjika namumbanda. Samisoni wamumweni kuwaha nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwahitili mafuku antesha wayili nakutambula mumbanda, hakutondolwela nindi atali hafwilayi mutupa. Kutala mpuka jasooka dehi mumujimba wamutupa, niwuchi iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawusendeli mumakasa, hakuya nikuya, hakudiila mukwenda, yoshika nikudi tata yindi namama yindi, yoyinkahuni kuyinkahu, hiyakudya nikudya; ilaŋa chalooleliyi wuchi mumujimba wamutupa hayilejeli kwinduku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tata yindi wakunkumukili kwadiŋiyi mumbanda. Samisoni watelekeshelukumawija, muloŋa dichi chelilaŋawu anyikwenzi amayala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chamu mwenuwu aleteli akwawu makumi asatu ashakami nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samisoni wayilili nindi, Leka niyitili chishimu; neyi mukutwesha kunlumbulwila chumumafuku awa atanu nayedi namutukudiila mawŋia, neyi munashinshiki muchaya, ami nakayinka mahina atooka ashina makumi asatu, niyikovweluyakuvwala makumi asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyi mukukaŋanya kuchinlumbulwila, enu yenu mwakanyinkami mahina atooka ashina makumi asatu, niyikovweluyakuvwala makumi asatu. Amwilili nawu, Taku chishimu cheyi tuchitiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuyila nindi, Mudi mukwakudya mwafumini yakudya, mudi mukwaŋovu mwafumini yatowala. Mwahitili mafuku asatu wena kutweshakulumbulula chishimu ochu nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku damu chitanu nachiyedi hiyakumwila iŋoda Samisoni, nawu, Mudimbeki nfumweyi atulumbulwili chishimu, mukunkulwayi tukukwochanineyi nimutaŋa watata yeyi nakesi. Mwatutambikili kulonda namutudiiliyuma yetu? Indi mwacheŋi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋoda Samisoni hakumudilila nindi, Eyi wuna kumini dakunhela hohu, hiwankepaku. Wunatili anyana kawaya michishimu, hakwinza ami kunlejamu nehi. Yena wamwilili nindi, Chikaŋa tata namama kuyilejamu kwami nehi, nikulejumu eyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamudililili mafuku atanu nayedi mwadiililuwu mawŋia awu, ifuku damu chitanu nachiyedi wamulejelumu muloŋa waswejeli kumukakeja, niyena mumbandahakuyileja anyana kawayindi chishimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku damu chitanu nachiyedi itaŋwa kanda dihumi, amayala akumukala owu amwilili nawu, Indi chabadi kawuchi kutowala chika? Indi wabadika mutupa Ŋovu hinyi? Kuchinkayena nindi, Neyi mwabula kudima naŋombi yami, mutenowu mwakeŋa a kwiluka chishimu chami wanyi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaYehova hakwinza hadi yena naŋovu, hakukunkumu kanakuya kuAshekeloni, hakutapa amayala akwenoku makumi asatu, hakutambula mahinawu, hakuyinka alumbulwili chishimu yi kovwelu yawuyakuvwala. Yohila nikuhila mbe, hakuya cheŋi kwitala datata yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa iŋoda Samisoni amwinkeliyi mukwawu wadiŋi ibwambu dindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
